<title>UK: Somerfield H1 profits 54.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Somerfield H1 profits 54.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty-eight weeks to Nov 9, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) proforma   13.0		   vs 10.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.4		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     54.6		   vs 43.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,714.1		vs 1,692.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 52.5 and 56.0 million stg. The results are the food retailer's first since flotation in August 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name - Somerfield Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
